{"guide":{"questionsToConsider":["Does the usage change your price, for example print or advertising rights?","How many rounds of revisions are included, and should the form say so?","Whose name do you need on the brief before you start: the person filling it in, or the person who approves it?","What's the smallest project you'll quote for?"],"howToUseResponses":"Read the approvers answer before you price: work that a committee signs off usually takes more rounds than work one person approves, so build that into the quote and address the proposal to whoever has the final say. A fixed deadline that's close means a rush rate or a smaller scope. For anyone who asked for your suggestion on budget, send two options at different sizes and let them choose.","customizeSteps":["Change the deliverables examples to the kind of work you do, so clients describe it in terms you can price.","Set the budget ranges to fit your rates, and keep the option for clients who want a suggestion.","Add the link to your portfolio, email signature and social bios, and check new requests in the dashboard."],"faqs":[{"q":"What should a freelance quote form include?","a":"What needs making, where it will be used, the deadline, who approves it and a budget range. Those answers change a price more than anything else."},{"q":"Should freelancers ask for a budget?","a":"Yes, as a range with an option to ask for your suggestion. It saves you quoting for work the client can't pay for."},{"q":"Why ask who signs off the work?","a":"More people approving means more feedback rounds. Knowing up front lets you price the revisions honestly."},{"q":"Can I put this quote form on my portfolio site?","a":"Yes. Use this template copies it into your account, where you can edit every question and then share a link or embed it on your site."}]},"doc":{"schemaVersion":9,"title":"Freelance quote","description":"Everything a freelancer needs to price a project before the first call.","blocks":[{"id":"blk_freelanc00","ref":"welcome","title":"Hi! Tell me about your project and I'll send you a quote.","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"buttonLabel":"Start","type":"welcome"},{"id":"blk_freelanc01","ref":"name","title":"What's your name?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"short_text","unique":false,"minLength":0,"maxLength":120},{"id":"blk_freelanc02","ref":"email","title":"And the best email for the quote?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"email","unique":false,"businessOnly":false,"allowedDomains":[],"verify":false},{"id":"blk_freelanc03","ref":"builds_on_existing","title":"Does this build on work that already exists, like a site, a draft or an earlier design?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"yes_no","yesLabel":"Yes, there's something already","noLabel":"No, it's new"},{"id":"blk_freelanc04","ref":"existing_link","title":"Where can I see what exists now?","description":"A link to the site, file or document is perfect.","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"url","unique":false,"httpsOnly":false},{"id":"blk_freelanc05","ref":"deliverables","title":"What do you need made? List the pieces as you see them.","description":"For example: a homepage and three inner pages, or ten product descriptions.","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":1500,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_freelanc06","ref":"usage","title":"Where will the work be used?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"multi_select","options":[{"id":"opt_website_or_app","label":"Website or app","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_social_media","label":"Social media","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_paid_advertising","label":"Paid advertising","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_print","label":"Print","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_internal_use_only","label":"Internal use only","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_resold_or_given","label":"Resold or given to clients","image_key":null}],"minSelections":1,"maxSelections":6,"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_freelanc07","ref":"references","title":"Any examples you like, or links I should look at?","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":800,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_freelanc08","ref":"deadline","title":"When do you need it finished?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"date","disablePast":true,"dateFormat":"YYYY-MM-DD","includeTime":false,"timeStepMinutes":30,"timeMin":"09:00","timeMax":"18:00"},{"id":"blk_freelanc09","ref":"deadline_fixed","title":"Is that date fixed?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"yes_no","yesLabel":"Yes, it can't move","noLabel":"No, there's some room"},{"id":"blk_freelanc10","ref":"approvers","title":"Who will sign off on the work?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_just_me","label":"Just me","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_me_and_one","label":"Me and one other person","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_a_team_or","label":"A team or a committee","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_freelanc11","ref":"final_say","title":"When the feedback disagrees, who has the final say?","description":"A name and role is enough. It tells me who to check with before each round.","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"short_text","unique":false,"minLength":0,"maxLength":160},{"id":"blk_freelanc12","ref":"budget","title":"Do you have a budget in mind?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,